## Documentation for API Endpoints

All URIs are relative to *http://localhost:4096*.

For `GET /api/fs/read/*`, use `OpencodeSdk.v2FsReadPath(path: ...)`. The
generated `FilesystemApi.v2FsRead()` method is deprecated because it sends the
OpenAPI wildcard literally instead of accepting the required path tail.

Use the `OpencodeSdk.*Stream()` replacements for SSE operations. They retry
errors with the upstream 3-second initial delay and 30-second cap, do not
reconnect after clean EOF, and forward the last parsed SSE `id` as
`Last-Event-ID`. For `v2SessionEventsStream`, durable replay is controlled by
the `after` query in the pinned server. If a server ignores `Last-Event-ID`, a
reconnect can replay an event already delivered to the consumer; delivery is
not exactly-once and consumers should deduplicate by durable sequence.

